  "instructions": [
    "Toss the cabbage with the lime juice, 1 tbsp olive oil, and 1/4 tsp salt in a bowl. Set aside.",
    "Heat 2 tbsp olive oil in a 12 inch skillet over medium heat for 1 minute.",
    "Add the black beans, cumin, paprika, garlic powder, and 1/2 tsp salt. Stir for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in the water. Cook 5 to 6 minutes, mashing about a third of the beans with a spoon, until thick and creamy.",
    "Move the beans to a bowl and wipe out the skillet. Return it to medium-high heat.",
    "Warm each tortilla in the dry skillet for 30 seconds per side, until soft and lightly browned in spots.",
    "Fill each tortilla with beans, a handful of slaw, and a few slices of avocado. Serve right away."
  ],
